# The embedder image (docker/embedder) builds with the repo root as its context,
# because its Dockerfile COPYs docker/embedder/*. Only that path and its own
# requirements are read; everything listed here is context the Dockerfile never
# touches, and shipping it whole (node_modules, .next, .git) is what makes a
# root-context build slow. The Go services build from backend/ and use
# backend/.dockerignore instead, so this file does not affect them.
.git
.gitnexus
frontend
docs
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.log
